  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "天公疼囝"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>游沛綺</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春--ê--啊！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你tio̍h-ài落雨　五穀suh奶</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規口灶tsiah飼ē飽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鳥仔翼ing-ia　積水窟hōo洗tn̄g</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Thìng好自由飛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春--ê--啊！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kōo ta̍p滴雨聲kā貼inn-inn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">幼嬰仔就bē koh háu半暝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春雷tân--一-下意思就好</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">對岸戰機siunn噪耳</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心魂bē定著</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh按怎飼ē大漢？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">媽祖婆tng出巡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣tse苦命囝　lán ài kā保庇平安順序</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">作者註：寫tsit條詩ê時tsūn，蔡英文總統tng去美國拜訪。我tī春天落雨暝睏bē落眠，想日--時看ê新聞，心內真感慨， 希望天公疼惜lán台灣，保庇lán ê自由民主，lán ê自由民主iáu未大漢、iáu真幼tsínn，ài好好仔寶惜。媽祖婆有兩層意思，一个是講總統，一个是講白沙屯媽祖。</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjGzD8r3Dli84clvIiAT8F_k_ZBW_LrDGynbdcXQw6SIHo9my1EYe02gNqM2hTI5UprJsjuyPH87u9HErb4QcpFziEs_Y8iU3Lz5ih77iEHKJKZArT6IYt_tscf0VaaFNK1CtLuQ1C6Rg7gKL7aDdypAJbOutBOq0GzqwZ5YviA7MB3Pc9EJSMVQKt46gI6/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1360%E6%9C%9F_13.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjGzD8r3Dli84clvIiAT8F_k_ZBW_LrDGynbdcXQw6SIHo9my1EYe02gNqM2hTI5UprJsjuyPH87u9HErb4QcpFziEs_Y8iU3Lz5ih77iEHKJKZArT6IYt_tscf0VaaFNK1CtLuQ1C6Rg7gKL7aDdypAJbOutBOq0GzqwZ5YviA7MB3Pc9EJSMVQKt46gI6/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1360%E6%9C%9F_13.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhqeTXCZL5QzweXsz-XJ0Hm4ZVC_WNzfSiZCmLj0wzVmC7ZBps55a0xj6EBj9pL0XPSIbcBWNuijPyDDDBKNfx6UFGNKpTVjYL1A7DGttOPZXk-rUbQ8QX1b_zDfEZ5p1G9SFBtdO77K9X563mWsZ553X7-B3gcIHJmPliEll7OlsvHzpbB2zqArhOu-6Rr/s1424/360%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhqeTXCZL5QzweXsz-XJ0Hm4ZVC_WNzfSiZCmLj0wzVmC7ZBps55a0xj6EBj9pL0XPSIbcBWNuijPyDDDBKNfx6UFGNKpTVjYL1A7DGttOPZXk-rUbQ8QX1b_zDfEZ5p1G9SFBtdO77K9X563mWsZ553X7-B3gcIHJmPliEll7OlsvHzpbB2zqArhOu-6Rr/w450-h640/360%E5%8F%B0%E